{"unit_id": "tag:02VZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是态射族（families of morphisms），目标（target）为<MATH_0004>。设<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>构成固定目标（fixed target）的映射（maps）族（families）的一个态射（morphism），见景（Sites），定义<REF_0001>。假设对每个<MATH_0008>，族（family）<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>的一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。则拉回（pullback）函子（functor）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0002>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0003>\n如引理<REF_0002>中所述，是完全忠实（fully faithful）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "两族概形态射。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标", "context": "固定目标映射族。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "所比较的族。"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族", "context": "固定目标映射的族。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "族之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "章名。"},