{"unit_id": "tag:02VZ:proof", "translation": "考虑概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0001>\n它在<MATH_0002>之上，在第<MATH_0003>个分量（component）上映射（maps）到第<MATH_0004>个分量（component），通过态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。我们断言<MATH_0006>是概形（schemes）的一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。事实上，由拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0001>，对每个<MATH_0007>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。因此，对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0009>（可视为<MATH_0010>的仿射开集（affine open）），我们能找到有限多个（finitely many）仿射开集（affine opens）\n<MATH_0011>\n（可视为<MATH_0012>的仿射开集（affine opens）），使得<MATH_0013>。这给出了<MATH_0014>的足够多的仿射开集（affine opens），它们可由<MATH_0015>的有限多个（finitely many）仿射开集（affine opens）覆盖（covered），从而拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0002>的第(3)项适用，断言随之成立。分别用<MATH_0016>和<SPACE_0001><MATH_0017>表示相对于<MATH_0018>和<SPACE_0002><MATH_0019>的下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（category），对<MATH_0020>和<MATH_0021>也类似。考虑图（diagram）\n<MATHSEG_0001>引理<MATHSEG_0002>引理<MATHSEG_0003>\n此图（diagram）是交换（commutative）的，见引理<REF_0003>的证明。垂直箭头（vertical arrows）是等价（equivalences）。因此，本引理由引理<REF_0004>得出，后者表明该图（diagram）上方的水平（horizontal）箭头（arrow）是完全忠实（fully faithful）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "component", "target_term": "分量"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "component", "target_term": "分量"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_te