{"unit_id": "tag:02VV:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下一个引理表明，为检验有效性（effectiveness），总可以对给定的态射族（family of morphisms）作扎里斯基加细（Zariski refine），其目标（target）为<MATH_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "effectiveness", "target_term": "有效性"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "Zariski refine", "target_term": "扎里斯基加细"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "effectiveness", "target_term": "有效性", "context": "下降数据有效性。"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "同目标态射族。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski refine", "target_term": "扎里斯基加细", "context": "Zariski加细操作。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "共同目标。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02VY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是态射族（families of morphisms），目标（target）为<MATH_0004>。设<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>构成固定目标（fixed target）的映射（maps）族（families）的一个态射（morphism），见景（Sites），定义<REF_0001>。假设对每个<MATH_0008>，族（family）<MATH_0009>是一个扎里斯基覆盖（Zariski covering）（见拓扑（Topologies），定义<REF_0002>），覆盖对象为<MATH_0010>。则拉回（pullback）函子（functor）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0002>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0003>\n如引理<REF_0003>中所述，是一个范畴等价（equivalence of categories）。特别地，概形（schemes）的范畴（category），其对象在<MATH_0011>之上，等价（equivalent）于下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（category），这些数据相对于<MATH_0012>的任意扎里斯基覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "同目标态射族。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标", "context": "映射族限定。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "映射族对象。"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族", "context": "固定目标映射族。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "族态射。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "章名。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "指标子族。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖", "context": "子族条件及任意覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "章名。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "下降数据拉回。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "拉回所给函子。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据限定。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "相对下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基上的概形。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "概形和下降数据范畴。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "范畴关系。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02VY:proof", "translation": "该函子（functor）由引理<REF_0001>可知是忠实（faithful）且完全忠实（fully faithful）的。下面说明如何证明它是本质满射（essentially surjective）的。设<MATH_0001>是相对于<MATH_0002>的一个下降（descent）数据（datum）。固定<MATH_0003>，并置<MATH_0004>。对于<MATH_0005>，注意存在一个典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0006>\n因此可以将<MATH_0007>由此态射（morphism）拉回（pullback），并置<MATH_0008>，对于<MATH_0009>。这样就得到一个下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0010>，相对于扎里斯基覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0011>。注意<MATH_0012>是一个同构（isomorphism），从开集（open）<MATH_0013>（属于<MATH_0014>）到<MATH_0015>的对应开集（open）。由概形（Schemes），第<REF_0002>节可知，可以将<MATH_0016>粘合（glue）为概形（scheme）<MATH_0017>，它在<MATH_0018>之上。此外，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0019>，对应于<MATH_0020>与<MATH_0021>，粘合（glue）为一个态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0022>\n满足余循环条件（cocycle condition）（细节省略）。于是得到所需的下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0023>，相对于<MATH_0024>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "拉回函子。"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实", "context": "函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实", "context": "函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射", "context": "由粘合证明的性质。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据限定。"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "所给及构造的下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "纤维积间典范态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "拉回所用及粘合所得态射。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "同构拉回。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "扎里斯基覆盖", "context": "粘合所用覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "开集间同构。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "被粘合概形的开集。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "章名。"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "对象与态射粘合。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "粘合所得概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "双指标态射。"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件", "context": "粘合态射的条件。"}], "notes": ["remark：原文明确省略粘合态射满足余循环条件的细节；忠实保留，不添加证明。"]}
{"unit_id": "tag:02W0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的fpqc-覆盖（coverings）。若<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的加细（refinement），则拉回（pullback）函子（functor）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0002>下降（descent）数据（data），相对于<MATHSEG_0003>\n是完全忠实（fully faithful）的。特别地，概形（schemes）的范畴（category），其对象在<MATH_0007>之上，被等同于下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（category）的一个全子范畴（full subcategory），这些数据相对于<MATH_0008>的任意fpqc-覆盖（covering）。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc-"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "full subcategory", "target_term": "全子范畴"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "两族fpqc覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细", "context": "两覆盖关系。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "加细下拉回。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "下降数据函子。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据限定。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实", "context": "函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term":